@startuml erd_003_event_store
!include common/erd_styles.puml

title Event Store (Append-Only Log) — Immutable

package "Event Store" {
  entity "Events" as Events {
    * event_id : UUID <<PK>>
    --
    finding_id : UUID <<indexed>>
    event_type : ENUM(FindingCreated, DispositionChanged, FindingClosed)
    timestamp : TIMESTAMPTZ <<ISO 8601 UTC>>
    logical_clock_physical : BIGINT
    logical_clock_logical : INTEGER
    logical_clock_node_id : TEXT
    actor : TEXT
    payload : JSONB
    event_hash : CHAR(64) <<SHA-256>>
  }
}

note bottom of Events
  **Hybrid Logical Clock (HLC)**
  Total ordering: physical_time → logical_counter → node_id → event_id

  **Invariants**
  • Events are immutable once written
  • No duplicate event_ids
  • HLC is monotonically non-decreasing
  • event_hash = SHA-256(event_id ‖ payload)
end note

@enduml
